This is a '''list of quotes by Veto when {{abi text|Evolution}} is activated''', having a filter applied to them. Veto is voiced by Bamar Kane in English. Necessary quotes translated are from French or Wolof to English, unless otherwise stated. There are a few voice lines unique to Evolution (marked with †). The Evolution set contains {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Veto Evolution Quotes}} quotes.

A downloadable folder containing all the audio files on this page can be found [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10UhEf9EFxuHEFMMNdjb1k3x-t4mx4Kom?usp=sharing here]. For the standard set, see [[Veto/Quotes]].

